re rice to top of cup. Invert onto a plate and carefully remove cup.","durationMinutes":null},{"n":6,"text":"Cut the remaining hard-boiled egg in half and serve the two halves along side the arroz tapado on the same plate.","sourceText":"Cut the remaining hard-boiled egg in half and serve the two halves along side the arroz tapado on the same plate.","durationMinutes":null}],"nutrition":null,"gaps":["Research extraction only; no culinary/editorial review.","Ingredient quantities, units, alternatives, food identities, aggregate duration, and nutrition remain unknown until individually parsed/reviewed.","Source-level CC BY-SA policy applies generally; page-specific exceptions have not been checked."]}},"parsedRecipe":{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"wikibooks:21837","recordId":"wikibooks-21837-r4512977","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceRevision":"4512977","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Peruvian%20Molded%20Rice%20(Arroz%20Tapado)&oldid=4512977","sourceSha256":"4222412df9d4df84de046605ae67202cef8b94f8745ce77f616512be6066e7b9","parserVersion":"wikibooks-sections-v3","quantityParserVersion":"source-prefix-v2","license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"reviewStatus":"source-extracted-unreviewed","changeNotice":"Source-language section extraction; markup removed. Not culinarily reviewed, translated or runt